{"comment_text": {"ja4:0.1": "", "ja4:0.2": "", "ja4:0.3": "", "ja4:0.4": "", "ja4:1.1": "The prose story tells of an enterprising young man who started his business by trading a dead mouse for a penny as cat food. This concept can be taken as a precursor for the modern concept of microfinance. ", "ja4:1.2": "", "ja4:1.3": "", "ja4:1.4": "", "ja4:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja4:0.1": "<article id='ja4'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja4:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja4:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja4:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja4:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja4:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja4:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja4:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja4:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja4:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja4:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja4:0.3": "Apaṇṇakavagga ", "ja4:0.4": "4. Cūḷaseṭṭhijātaka ", "ja4:1.1": "“Appakenapi medhāvī, ", "ja4:1.2": "pābhatena vicakkhaṇo; ", "ja4:1.3": "Samuṭṭhāpeti attānaṁ, ", "ja4:1.4": "aṇuṁ aggiṁva sandhaman”ti. ", "ja4:2.1": "Cūḷaseṭṭhijātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja4:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 4 ", "ja4:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja4:0.3": "Sure Bet ", "ja4:0.4": "The Little Financier: a past life story ", "ja4:1.1": "Even with a little capital ", "ja4:1.2": "the intelligent and clear-seeing man ", "ja4:1.3": "uplifts himself, ", "ja4:1.4": "like a tiny flame when fanned. ", "ja4:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja4:0.1": "", "ja4:0.2": "", "ja4:0.3": "", "ja4:0.4": "", "ja4:1.1": "", "ja4:1.2": "", "ja4:1.3": "", "ja4:1.4": "", "ja4:2.1": "Cūḷaseṭṭhijātakaṁ → culla (bj); cullaka (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja4:0.1": "", "ja4:0.2": "", "ja4:0.3": "", "ja4:0.4": "", "ja4:1.1": "ms22J_8, msdiv4, ndp22.4, pts-vp-pli1.122", "ja4:1.2": "", "ja4:1.3": "", "ja4:1.4": "", "ja4:2.1": "ms22J_9"}, "keys_order": ["ja4:0.1", "ja4:0.2", "ja4:0.3", "ja4:0.4", "ja4:1.1", "ja4:1.2", "ja4:1.3", "ja4:1.4", "ja4:2.1"]}